1130:  *
1131:  * The order is load-bearing: mirror the tree, regenerate the identity-overlaid config, restart the
1132:  * stack IF the configuration it was started with has changed, then read the stack, prove it is
1133:  * local, wait for readiness, reset, wait again, and prove the migration set replayed.
