se_db_ai4good-slot-1\"}}\n\nProbe B resolves the identity correctly and says so: no such container supabase_db_ai4good-slot-1.\nCONCLUSION, now built into the code: the pool always passes --workdir AND sets the working\ndirectory to the same slot. The flag says which project; the working directory stops anything\nelse from claiming to be one. The first setup attempt on this machine ran with the working\ndirectory on the repo: supabase start found the personal database container healthy, decided\nthe project was already running, and exited zero having created no slot container at all.\n\n=== the personal stack, read BEFORE setup (a read; nothing is written to it) ===\nStopped services: [supabase_imgproxy_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu supabase_pooler_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu]\n{\"DB_URL\":\"postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres\",\"API_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321\",\"REST_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1\",\"GRAPHQL_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/graphql/v1\",\"FUNCTIONS_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1\",\"MCP_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/mcp\",\"STUDIO_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54323\",\"PUBLISHABLE_KEY\":\"<redacted-key>\",\"SECRET_KEY\":\"<redacted-key>\",\"JWT_SECRET\":\"<redacted>\",\"ANON_KEY\":\"<redacted-jwt>\",\"SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\":\"<redacted-jwt>\",\"MAILPIT_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\",\"INBUCKET_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\",\"STORAGE_S3_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/storage/v1/s3\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_ID\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_REGION\":\"local\",\"message\":\"\"}\n\n=== removing the two slot directories left by the first, failed attempt ===\nslot-1 present after removal: False\nslot-2 present after removal: False\ncontainers named for a slot before setup: \n\n=== bun tests/at/harness/db-pool.ts setup ===\ndb-pool setup â€” pool root C:\\Users\\nirdr\\AppData\\Local\\ai4good-build\\db-slots\ndb-pool setup â€” source configuration C:\\Users\\nirdr\\Downloads\\ai4good\\.claude\\worktrees\\agent-a064eb77d7bb37dd7\\supabase\\config.toml\ndb-pool setup â€” personal stack project id poancmeitlmxejofwzuu (read only; never started, stopped or reset here)\n\ndb-pool setup â€” slot 1 at C:\\Users\\nirdr\\AppData\\Local\\ai4good-build\\db-slots\\slot-1\n  port  [api] port: 54321 -> 55321\n  port  [db] port: 54322 -> 55322\n  port  [db] shadow_port: 54320 -> 55320\n  port  [db.pooler] port: 54329 -> 55329\n  port  [studio] port: 54323 -> 55323\n  port  [local_smtp] port: 54324 -> 55324\n  port  [edge_runtime] inspector_port: 8083 -> 8093\n  port  [analytics] port: 54327 -> 55327\n  wrote C:\\Users\\nirdr\\AppData\\Local\\ai4good-build\\db-slots\\slot-1\\supabase\\config.toml (project_id ai4good-slot-1)\n  starting slot 1 â€” this pulls container images on a first run\n  slot 1 API_URL http://127.0.0.1:55321\n  slot 1 DB_URL  postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:55322/postgres\n  slot 1 keys    issued (values deliberately not printed)\n\ndb-pool setup â€” slot 2 at C:\\Users\\nirdr\\AppData\\Local\\ai4good-build\\db-slots\\slot-2\n  port  [api] port: 54321 -> 56321\n  port  [db] port: 54322 -> 56322\n  port  [db] shadow_port: 54320 -> 56320\n  port  [db.pooler] port: 54329 -> 56329\n  port  [studio] port: 54323 -> 56323\n  port  [local_smtp] port: 54324 -> 56324\n  port  [edge_runtime] inspector_port: 8083 -> 8103\n  port  [analytics] port: 54327 -> 56327\n  wrote C:\\Users\\nirdr\\AppData\\Local\\ai4good-build\\db-slots\\slot-2\\supabase\\config.toml (project_id ai4good-slot-2)\n  starting slot 2 â€” this pulls container images on a first run\n  slot 2 API_URL http://127.0.0.1:56321\n  slot 2 DB_URL  postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:56322/postgres\n  slot 2 keys    issued (values deliberately not printed)\n\ndb-pool setup â€” reading the personal stack (a read; nothing is written to it)\n  personal API_URL http://127.0.0.1:54321\n  personal DB_URL  postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres\n\ndb-pool setup â€” slot 1: ai4good-slot-1, a