\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_ID\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_REGION\":\"local\",\"message\":\"\"}\n\n=== the personal stack, read AFTER setup (still its own project, still the 54321 block) ===\nStopped services: [supabase_imgproxy_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu supabase_pooler_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu]\n{\"DB_URL\":\"postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres\",\"API_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321\",\"REST_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1\",\"GRAPHQL_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/graphql/v1\",\"FUNCTIONS_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1\",\"MCP_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/mcp\",\"STUDIO_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54323\",\"PUBLISHABLE_KEY\":\"<redacted-key>\",\"SECRET_KEY\":\"<redacted-key>\",\"JWT_SECRET\":\"<redacted>\",\"ANON_KEY\":\"<redacted-jwt>\",\"SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\":\"<redacted-jwt>\",\"MAILPIT_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\",\"INBUCKET_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\",\"STORAGE_S3_URL\":\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/storage/v1/s3\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_ID\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET\":\"<redacted>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_REGION\":\"local\",\"message\":\"\"}\n\n=== containers running AFTER setup ===\nai4good-runner | Up 3 days\nsupabase_analytics_ai4good-slot-1 | Up About a minute (healthy)\nsupabase_analytics_ai4good-slot-2 | Up 25 seconds (healthy)\nsupabase_analytics_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | Up 7 hours (healthy)\nsupabase_auth_ai4good-slot-1 | Up About a minute (healthy)\nsupabase_auth_ai4good-slot-2 | Up 23 seconds (healthy)\nsupabase_auth_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | Up 7 hours (healthy)\nsupabase_db_ai4good-slot-1 | Up About a minute (healthy)\nsupabase_db_ai4good-slot-2 | Up 46 seconds (healthy)\nsupabase_db_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | Up 7 hours (healthy)\nsupabase_edge_runtime_ai4good-slot-1 | Up About a minute\nsupabase_edge_runtime_ai4good-slot-2 | Up 20 seconds\nsupabase_edge_runtime_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | Up 6 hours\nsupabase_inbucket_ai4good-slot-1 | Up About a minute (healthy)\nsupabase