 slot 2 canary written: \\\"slot-2 canary\\\"\\n48: \\n49: === (e) the pre-destructive identity read on slot 2 ===\\n50: db-pool â€” slot 2 identity proven before the reset: project ai4good-slot-2, api 56321, db 56322\\n51:   the line above is the helper stating which project the CLI resolved, before anything destructive.\\n52: \\n53: === (f) supabase db reset, aimed at slot 2, through the helper, hostile variable present ===\\n54: db-pool â€” slot 2 identity proven before the reset: project ai4good-slot-2, api 56321, db 56322\\n55:   the reset exited zero.\\n56: \\n57: === (g) the canaries after the reset ===\\n58:   slot 1 canary: \\\"slot-1 canary\\\"\\n59:   slot 2 canary: null\\n60: \\n61: === (h) AFTER: the same docker identity snapshot, compared on identity fields only ===\\n62:   /supabase_analytics_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 4f0cbd08610dfdd42c6c93fb9abf1eed25ecf5043bab3afa24bdad364837795d | created 2026-08-09T22:30:36.397633849Z | image public.ecr.aws/supabase/logflare:1.47.1 | ports {\\\"4000/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54327\\\"}]}\\n63:   /supabase_auth_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 38d058a45856033b6715edbb78b4fce73392283ff9930e9043fe490031d324f0 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:38.180055558Z | image public.ecr.aws/supabase/gotrue:v2.193.0 | ports {}\\n64:   /supabase_db_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id a9fc53b713132db35df62f08563a31552eb93662efd925e6e35efe19b9e7c588 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:25.016886496Z | image public.ecr.aws/supabase/postgres:17.6.1.143 | ports {\\\"5432/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54322\\\"}]}\\n65:   /supabase_inbucket_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 05a41d3f900184d874744b3f69099877ddcaad0facc5cdedeab768acb03e6937 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:38.737406565Z | image public.ecr.aws/supabase/mailpit:v1.30.2 | ports {\\\"8025/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54324\\\"}]}\\n66:   /supabase_kong_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id c60a42f259068af05d0cffe4a8a2e21e49378fe644d69c1d0a144c747a20ba10 | c