project; the working directory stops anything\\n53: else from claiming to be one. The first setup attempt on this machine ran with the working\\n54: directory on the repo: supabase start found the personal database container healthy, decided\\n55: the project was already running, and exited zero having created no slot container at all.\\n56: \\n57: === the personal stack, read BEFORE setup (a read; nothing is written to it) ===\\n58: Stopped services: [supabase_imgproxy_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu supabase_pooler_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu]\\n59: {\\\"DB_URL\\\":\\\"postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres\\\",\\\"API_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321\\\",\\\"REST_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/rest/v1\\\",\\\"GRAPHQL_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/graphql/v1\\\",\\\"FUNCTIONS_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1\\\",\\\"MCP_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/mcp\\\",\\\"STUDIO_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54323\\\",\\\"PUBLISHABLE_KEY\\\":\\\"<redacted-key>\\\",\\\"SECRET_KEY\\\":\\\"<redacted-key>\\\",\\\"JWT_SECRET\\\":\\\"<redacted>\\\",\\\"ANON_KEY\\\":\\\"<redacted-jwt>\\\",\\\"SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\\\":\\\"<redacted-jwt>\\\",\\\"MAILPIT_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\\\",\\\"INBUCKET_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54324\\\",\\\"STORAGE_S3_URL\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:54321/storage/v1/s3\\\",\\\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_ID\\\":\\\"<redacted>\\\",\\\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET\\\":\\\"<redacted>\\\",\\\"S3_PROTOCOL_REGION\\\":\\\"local\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"\\\"}\\n60: \\n61: === removing the two slot directories left by the first, failed attempt ===\\n62: slot-1 present after removal: False\\n63: slot-2 present after removal: False\\n64: containers named for a slot before setup: \\n65: \\n66: === bun tests/at/harness/db-pool.ts setup ===\\n67: db-pool setup — pool root C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\ai4good-build\\\\db-slots\\n68: db-pool setup — source configuration C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\Downloads\\\\ai4good\\\\.claude\\\\worktrees\\\\agent-a064eb77d7bb37dd7\\\\supabase\\\\config.toml\\n69: db-pool setup — personal stack project id poancmeitlmxejofwzuu (read only; never started, stopped or reset here)\\n70: \\n71: db-pool setup — slot 1 at C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\ai4good-build\\\\db-slots\\\\slot-1\\n72:   port  [api] port: 54321 -> 55321\\n73:   port  [db] port: 54322 -> 55322\\n74:   port  [db] shadow_port: 54320 -> 55320\\n75:   port  [db.pooler] port: 54329 -> 55329\\n76:   port  [studio] port: 54323 -> 55323\\n77:   port  [local_smtp] port: 54324 -> 55324\\n78:   port  [edge_runtime] inspector_port: 8083 -> 8093\\n79:   port  [analytics] port: 54327 -> 55327\\n80:   wrote C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\ai4good-build\\\\db-slots\\\\slot-1\\\\supabase\\\\config.toml (project_id ai4good-slot-1)\\n81:   starting slot 1 — this pulls container images on a first run\\n82:   slot 1 API_URL http://127.0.0.1:55321\\n83:   slot 1 DB_URL  postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:55322/postgres\\n84:   slot 1 keys    issued (values deliberately not printed)\\n85: \\n86: db-pool setup — slot 2 at C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\ai4good-build\\\\db-slots\\\\slot-2\\n87:   port  [api] port: 54321 -> 56321\\n88:   port  [db] port: 54322 -> 56322\\n89:   port  [db] shadow_port: 54320 -> 56320\\n90:   port  [db.pooler] port: 54329 -> 56329\\n91:   port  [studio] port: 54323 -> 56323\\n92:   port  [local_smtp] port: 54324 -> 56324\\n93:   port  [edge_runtime] inspector_port: 8083 -> 8103\\n94:   port  [analytics] port: 54327 -> 56327\\n95:   wrote C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\ai4good-build\\\\db-slots\\\\slot-2\\\\supabase\\\\config.toml (project_id ai4good-slot-2)\\n96:   starting slot 2 — this pulls container images on a first run\\n97:   slot 2 API_URL http://127.0.0.1:56321\\n98:   slot 2 DB_URL  postgresql://<redacted>@127.0.0.1:56322/postgres\\n99:   slot 2 keys    issued (values deliberately not printed)\\n100: \\n101: db-pool setup — reading the