  measured on this machine (T10/X1: the winner's exclusive-create handle holds the file with
  no sharing until Dispose â€” a concurrent reader gets a sharing violation, not the content).
  So an override run inside that window takes a slot whose reservation names another item â€”
  the exact refusal ruling T5 establishes, missing on this one path; fail-open against E7's
