a198ffeMeZOHEAs76N82N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feac0a1b2001bNVdsJOjghHikq\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"4e00b557c368aede17acb695fbe63696db55d5ff\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feac08f60001H5Uv59Rrx8doMv\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01541a198ffeMeZOHEAs76N82N\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":93836,\"input\":2798,\"output\":114,\"reasoning\":172,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":90752}},\"cost\":0.0003629528}}\r\n+{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1786349923066,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01541a198ffeMeZOHEAs76N82N\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_feac0aaf80018TmuyErYfY7ys3\",\"messageID\":\"msg_feac0a3810011SsTqwR4AHKkj1\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_01541a198ffeMeZOHEAs76N82N\",\"snapshot\":\"31f2d0c0b9d77f6a8614676849b4d5006d38b253\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\r\n+{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1786349926454,\"sessionID\":\"ses_01541a198ffeMeZOHEAs76N82N\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_00_pdTp9wuSF163VXJuPcKz7696\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\Downloads\\\\ai4good\\\\.claude\\\\worktrees\\\\agent-a064eb77d7bb37dd7\\\\loop\\\\items\\\\AI4DEV-79\\\\spike-isolation.txt\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\Downloads\\\\ai4good\\\\.claude\\\\worktrees\\\\agent-a064eb77d7bb37dd7\\\\loop\\\\items\\\\AI4DEV-79\\\\spike-isolation.txt</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: \\n2: AI4DEV-79 (parallel DB slot pool) - step S3, the isolation spike, run on the dev machine.\\n3: \\n4: REDACTION: every line below passed a redactor before it was written. JWT tokens (eyJ...),\\n5: sb_ keys and database passwords are replaced. Nothing was removed for any other reason.\\n6: \\n7: machine   : MYPC\\n8: worktree  : C:\\\\Users\\\\nirdr\\\\Downloads\\\\ai4good\\\\.claude\\\\worktrees\\\\agent-a064eb77d7bb37dd7\\n9: branch    : nirdrang/ai4dev-79-a-pool-of-local-database-slots-so-items-verify-in-parallel\\n10: head      : 1d62271239700059e38c9bac1dec17169ba4f14b\\n11: \\n12: === containers,