r personal project id. That is the exact override that\\n23: destroyed the personal database on 2026-08-09. It is deliberately left in place: the wall is\\n24: the positive identity the shared helper states, not the absence of the override.\\n25:   .env line 1 names the personal project id: True\\n26: \\n27: === (a) BEFORE: docker identity snapshot of the personal stack (a READ; nothing is written) ===\\n28:   /supabase_analytics_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 4f0cbd08610dfdd42c6c93fb9abf1eed25ecf5043bab3afa24bdad364837795d | created 2026-08-09T22:30:36.397633849Z | ports {\\\"4000/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54327\\\"}]}\\n29:   /supabase_auth_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 38d058a45856033b6715edbb78b4fce73392283ff9930e9043fe490031d324f0 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:38.180055558Z | ports {}\\n30:   /supabase_db_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id a9fc53b713132db35df62f08563a31552eb93662efd925e6e35efe19b9e7c588 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:25.016886496Z | ports {\\\"5432/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54322\\\"}]}\\n31:   /supabase_inbucket_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 05a41d3f900184d874744b3f69099877ddcaad0facc5cdedeab768acb03e6937 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:38.737406565Z | ports {\\\"8025/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54324\\\"}]}\\n32:   /supabase_kong_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id c60a42f259068af05d0cffe4a8a2e21e49378fe644d69c1d0a144c747a20ba10 | created 2026-08-09T22:30:37.447243163Z | ports {\\\"8000/tcp\\\":[{\\\"HostIp\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"HostPort\\\":\\\"54321\\\"}]}\\n33:   /supabase_pg_meta_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id dd9e8be3bb873f596ff92236e3d604ac10303cd5da8c5227e50e7b9f6d54dafd | created 2026-08-09T22:30:41.700396649Z | ports {}\\n34:   /supabase_realtime_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id e1a443bf280ab38ab8bf6cfdc3947bda9540f0fda03557188b94d50a0ca75f2b | created 2026-08-09T22:30:39.298314473Z | ports {}\\n35:   /supabase_rest_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu | id 720fc47910c49a2e12f0b6ef8386a29b651ed61ba01611aad962c580f2a798ef | cr